 have a look at that


Taking the four of them together rather
than one after another.

Let me get the shape of this first.

ls ✓ 7L ~100t
find **/*.go ✓ 2L ~8t
find **/*.toml ✓ 1L ~4t
grep package *.go ✓ 2L ~100t
Three searches, all at once.

Now to find where the drawing happens.

grep spinner *.go ✓ 1L ~100t
grep footer *.go ✓ 1L ~100t
grep cursor *.go ✓ 1L ~100t

One more pair, and one of them will not
be there.

ls ✓ 7L ~100t
read nowhere… ✗ 1L ~100t nowhere/at/a…

That is the lot: four together, then
three together, then a pair where only
one of them could be answered.
